# Read by ripgrep (and so by Grep/Glob tooling) but not by git.
# These trees are bulk data or run output that dominate churn in the history
# (thousands of preset files, screenshots, playwright output) and bury real
# source hits. Search them explicitly with `rg --no-ignore <pattern> <path>`.
public/milkdrop-presets/
output/
screenshots/
.playwright-cli/
